<title>HUNGARY: Hungary six-month T-bill yield falls to 19.71 pct.</title>
<headline>Hungary six-month T-bill yield falls to 19.71 pct.</headline>
<dateline>BUDAPEST 1997-06-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>The average annual yield on Hungary's six-month discount treasury bills was set by auction at 19.71 percent, down from 20.47 percent set at an auction held two weeks ago, the Government Debt Management Agency said.</p>
<p>    Total on offer	     17,000 million forints</p>
<p>    Total bids received	55,900.26 million forints</p>
<p>    Total allocated	    17,000 million forints</p>
<p>    Total issued		 18,500 million forints</p>
<p>    Average annual yield	    19.71 pct</p>
<p>    Average price		     91.0515 pct</p>
<p>-- Budapest newsroom (36 1) 327 4040</p>
</text>
